OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA good deal of dry weather for
OL,6,Fmuch of the day but a few showers not
OL,7,Fto be ruled out. Best of the sunnier
OL,8,Fspells in the afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA bright evening with
OL,11,Fvariable amounts of cloud. The rest of
OL,12,Fthe night will then be dry for the
OL,13,Fmost part, however Shetland may see
OL,14,Fsome showers later.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA few showers at first across
OL,17,FShetland, otherwise a dry and bright
OL,18,Fmorning. Cloud will thicken through
OL,19,Fthe afternoon, with outbreaks of rain
OL,20,Fspreading northwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
