OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of occasionally heavy rain.
OL,8,FDrier and brighter on Thursday with
OL,9,Fthe risk of a few showers.
